    55	/**
    56	 * The shell: a bottom bar with the three destinations and a host for whatever each one shows.
    57	 *
    58	 * Insets belong to [Scaffold] here, which is why the activity stopped padding its own content in S0.8 -
    59	 * two padders would either double the gap or clip the bar's background.
